message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the article and the archived repository."
title: "DUH-SCS-TOPMODEL-LSTM (Continuous Simulation): a differentiable hybrid rainfall-runoff model for hourly continuous streamflow simulation"
abstract: >-
  Source code, processed dataset and per-run results for a multi-seed nested-baseline
  ablation (13 configurations x 10 seeds) evaluating where and how embedded physics helps a
  differentiable rainfall-runoff model in hourly continuous simulation in the Preto River
  catchment (Manuel Duarte, ANA 58585000), Brazilian Atlantic Forest.
